MBSA integration
MBSA derives the MXFP6 index scorers' DeepGEMM code from
https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM, via the maxwell-model/DeepGEMM fork
(https://github.com/maxwell-model/DeepGEMM):

  python/mbsa/mxfp6/csrc/sm100_utils.cuh
    Definitions from deep_gemm/include/deep_gemm/{common,ptx,mma}/ at
    maxwell-model/DeepGEMM acc39c15353f46dec5ded3e78687d6ef897eea9d, reduced
    to what the scorers use.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/csrc/paged_mqa_logits_scheduler.cuh
    deep_gemm/include/deep_gemm/scheduler/paged_mqa_logits.cuh at
    deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM a6b593d2826719dcf4892609af7b84ee23aaf32a, reformatted.
  python/mbsa/mxfp6/csrc/sm100_fp6_paged_mqa_logits.cuh
    Derived from deep_gemm/include/deep_gemm/impls/
    sm100_fp4_paged_mqa_logits.cuh at a6b593d2826719dcf4892609af7b84ee23aaf32a.

Original copyright and license identifiers are retained in each file header.
No DeepGEMM or CUTLASS header tree is vendored.
